      `we are entitled to an income-based jobseeker's allowance` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you and your partner entitled to an income-based jobseeker's allowance?
      `my partner is entitled to state pension credit` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is your partner entitled to state pension credit?
      `I am entitled to an employment and support allowance` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you entitled to an employment and support allowance?
      `my partner is entitled to an income-related employment and support allowance` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is your partner entitled to an income-related employment and support allowance?
      `the period is less than a week` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the period you are asking about less than a week?
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `Under section 124(4), how much income support am I entitled to in pounds a week` IS
    `s 124(4) the amount of income support in pounds a week` (`s 124(1) the person is entitled to income support` (JUST `I am over 16`) `my facts`) `I have no income` `my income in pounds a week` `my applicable amount in pounds a week` `the period is less than a week`
    WHERE
        `my facts` MEANS `s 124(1) Facts about the claimant` WITH
            `the person is in Great Britain` IS `I am in Great Britain`
            `the person has attained the qualifying age for state pension credit` IS `I have reached the qualifying age for state pension credit`
            `the person has no income` IS `I have no income`
            `the person's income in pounds a week` IS `my income in pounds a week`
            `the applicable amount in pounds a week` IS `my applicable amount in pounds a week`
            `the person is engaged in remunerative work` IS `I am engaged in remunerative work`
            `the person is a member of a couple` IS `I am a member of a couple`
            `the other member of the couple is engaged in remunerative work` IS `my partner is engaged in remunerative work`
            `the person is within the 15 days after returning to work with the same employer (section 127(b))` IS `I am within the 15 days after returning to work with the same employer`
            `the person is receiving relevant education` IS `I am receiving relevant education`
            `the circumstances are ones prescribed in which the person may receive relevant education` IS `the circumstances are ones prescribed in which I may receive relevant education`
            `the person falls within a prescribed category of person` IS `I fall within a prescribed category of person`
            `the person is entitled to a jobseeker's allowance` IS `I am entitled to a jobseeker's allowance`
            `the other member of the couple is entitled to a jobseeker's allowance` IS `my partner is entitled to a jobseeker's allowance`
            `the couple are entitled to an income-based jobseeker's allowance` IS `we are entitled to an income-based jobseeker's allowance`
            `the other member of the couple is entitled to state pension credit` IS `my partner is entitled to state pension credit`
            `the person is entitled to an employment and support allowance` IS `I am entitled to an employment and support allowance`
            `the other member of the couple is entitled to an income-related employment and support allowance` IS `my partner is entitled to an income-related employment and support allowance`

@export Under section 126(2), what is my maternity period?
