@export Under section 137(1), are the other person and I a couple?
GIVEN `we are married to each other` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you and the other person married to each other?
      `we are civil partners of each other` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you and the other person civil partners of each other?
