            `one member` IS `a placeholder person`
            `the other member` IS `a placeholder person`
            `married to each other` IS `we are married to each other`
            `civil partners of each other` IS `we are civil partners of each other`
            `members of the same household` IS `we are members of the same household`
            `living together as if married or civil partners` IS `we are living together as if married or civil partners`
        `a placeholder person` MEANS Person WITH
            `date of birth` IS Date 1 1 2000
