            `marital status` IS `neither married nor in a civil partnership`
            `date of attaining pensionable age` IS Date 1 1 2000

§ `Part VIII -- The social fund (ss 138-140), and Part 8A -- Health in pregnancy grant (ss 140A, 140B)`

-- Payments out of the social fund arise only for a person who has applied for one, and health in pregnancy grant only for a person who was pregnant before 1 January 2011: the form can ask "Have you applied for a payment from the social fund?" and "Were you pregnant before 1 January 2011?" before showing each group.

@export Under section 138(1), may the payment I am asking about be made out of the social fund?
GIVEN `the kind of payment` IS A `s 138(1) Kind of payment` @desc Which kind of payment is it? Choose: maternity expenses; funeral expenses; community care grant; crisis loan; budgeting loan; or some other kind
      `the amount is prescribed and the circumstances are prescribed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the amount one that regulations prescribe, in circumstances that regulations prescribe?
      `the payment is in accordance with directions given or guidance issued by the Secretary of State` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the payment in accordance with directions given or guidance issued by the Secretary of State?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 138(1), may the payment I am asking about be made out of the social fund` IS
    `s 138(1) the payment may be made out of the social fund` `the kind of payment` `the amount is prescribed and the circumstances are prescribed` `the payment is in accordance with directions given or guidance issued by the Secretary of State`

