GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `Under section 155, what is the most statutory sick pay my employer must pay me in one period of entitlement` IS
    `s 155(4) the entitlement limit in pounds` (`s 157(1) the weekly rate of statutory sick pay in pounds` `my normal weekly earnings in pounds`)

@export Under section 156, may my employer withhold my statutory sick pay for a day because they were not told in time (s 156(2))?
