    `s 157(3) the amount of statutory sick pay payable in respect of the day in pounds` (`s 157(1) the weekly rate of statutory sick pay in pounds` `my normal weekly earnings in pounds`) `the number of my qualifying days in that week`

@export Under section 161, do the statutory sick pay rules apply to me as someone employed by the Crown (s 161)?
GIVEN `I am employed by or under the Crown` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you employed by or under the Crown?
      `I serve as a member of Her Majesty's forces, in that capacity` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you serve as a member of Her Majesty's forces, in that capacity?
