@export Under schedule 7 paragraph 21, is the death of a person with a pulmonary disease treated as caused by that disease?
GIVEN `the day of the death` IS A DATE @desc On what day did the person die?
      `they died as a result of a pulmonary disease` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the person die as a result of a pulmonary disease?
